  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for DotNetBoost.Auditing: minimal-API endpoints for reading a\n      trail — filtered, paged and always bounded — plus the HttpContext-backed actor accessor that\n      records who made each change. The endpoints require authorization by default, because a trail\n      says who did what and that is not data to serve anonymously; the erasure and prune endpoints\n      are not mapped at all unless asked for.",
